            "id": 149952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa el código para crear una clase <code>Player</code> vacía.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>class Player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proporciona a tu clase <code>Player</code> un constructor vacío.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>constructor() {}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega los parámetros <code>name</code>, y luego <code>health</code> al constructor de la clase <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"40\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>name, health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una nueva propiedad llamada <code>score</code> usando <code>this</code>. Asígnale el valor del parámetro <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"92\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameSession\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level, score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>this.score = score;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una nueva instancia de una sesión de juego con <code>1</code> nivel y <code>0</code> puntuación. Guárdala en una constante llamada <code>session</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"136\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameSession\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level, score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" session = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" GameSession(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(session);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const session = new GameSession(1, 0);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega un método <code>print</code> a la clase <code>ScoreCounter</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ScoreCounter\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Programa un método <code>add</code> que reciba un parámetro <code>points</code> dentro de la clase <code>ScoreCounter</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"141\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ScoreCounter\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>add</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>points</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega un método a la clase <code>ScoreCounter</code> llamado <code>subtract</code> con el parámetro <code>points</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"159\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ScoreCounter\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>subtract(points)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una constante <code>counter1</code>. Crea una nueva instancia de <code>ScoreCounter</code> y guárdala en la constante.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"227\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ScoreCounter\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ScoreCounter();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const counter1 = new ScoreCounter();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a los métodos del contador de puntuación para sumar <code>9</code>, restar <code>6</code>, y luego mostrar el resultado con <code>print()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print();\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"228\" endIndex=\"244\" /><option startIndex=\"245\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"284\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ScoreCounter\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ScoreCounter();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"counter1.add(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"counter1.subtract(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"counter1.print();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>counter1.add(9);</code> seguido de <code>counter1.subtract(6);</code> y finalmente <code>counter1.print();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una instancia de la clase <code>Item</code> y guárdala en la variable <code>potion1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Item\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, rarity) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".rarity = rarity;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" potion1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Item(\" /><text value=\"&quot;healthPotion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;common&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>new</code> seguido de <code>Item</code> y luego <code>(\"healthPotion\", \"common\")</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Establece <code>potion1.rarity</code> a <code>\"rare\"</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"239\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Item\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, rarity) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".rarity = rarity;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" potion1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Item(\" /><text value=\"&quot;healthPotion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;common&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sword1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Item(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ironSword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;uncommon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(potion1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"potion1.rarity = \" /><text value=\"&quot;rare&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(potion1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>potion1.rarity = \"rare\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambia el <code>message</code> de <code>quest1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"174\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Quest\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;firstSteps&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;bossFight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest1.message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins to open the gate!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>quest1.message</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega una propiedad <code>completed</code> para que todas las misiones puedan rastrear si están hechas.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"likes\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Quest\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".completed = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;firstSteps&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;bossFight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest1.message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins to open the gate!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest2.message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the boss to finish the level!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>this.completed</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y luego <code>false</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama al método <code>complete()</code> recién agregado en ambas instancias.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Quest.complete();\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"339\" endIndex=\"357\" /><option startIndex=\"358\" endIndex=\"376\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Quest\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".completed = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" complete() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".completed = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;firstSteps&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quest2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Quest(\" /><text value=\"&quot;bossFight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest1.message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins to open the gate!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest2.message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the boss to finish the level!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest1.complete();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quest2.complete();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>quest1.complete();</code> seguido de <code>quest2.complete();</code>.</p></body></html>"
